Subject: [PATCH] fix(agent): conta le ricerche web fatte dal worker / count
 web searches made by the worker

IT: worker e API passavano un provider di ricerca senza il callback del contatore, quindi le ricerche riuscite non finivano in search_stats. Ora usano createCountingWebProvider.

EN: the worker and the API passed a search provider with no counter callback, so successful searches never reached search_stats. They now use createCountingWebProvider.
